WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.010
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:09.060
Today I am going to explain a Russian science
fiction action film called “Coma.”

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:10.370
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:16.460
Watch out and take care!

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:21.599
At the beginning of the movie, we are shown
a utopian city with white futuristic buildings

00:00:21.599 --> 00:00:22.980
and no people.

00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:26.689
But soon, the buildings start to decay and
turn black.

00:00:26.689 --> 00:00:31.229
In the following scene, a miniature model
of the same city is in an apartment.

00:00:31.229 --> 00:00:37.719
An architect wakes up right next to it and
is confused about his location.

00:00:37.719 --> 00:00:41.160
He looks at a picture of himself and a girl
with a distorted face.

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:44.129
Suddenly, the things in the apartment start
to deteriorate.

00:00:44.129 --> 00:00:48.410
The architect looks at the blackening ceiling
in surprise and comes out of the room.

00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:51.550
Outside, is a stranger who is deteriorating
as well.

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:56.179
The confused man then runs outside the building
and finds himself in a strange world where

00:00:56.179 --> 00:01:00.100
buildings are levitating in the sky and the
people are fading away.

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:04.690
He looks around the place in fascination and
comes across a monstrous creature that seems

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:06.860
to be melting and regenerating.

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:10.640
The creature attacks the architect and makes
him fall to the ground.

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:13.680
When he opens his eyes again, two people stand
in front of him.

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:18.160
The group takes the architect and runs away
from the creature who follows them behind.

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:22.810
While in the chase, they jump from building
to building defying the laws of physics.

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:26.860
At one point they even jump on the road right
above them proving that gravity doesn’t

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:28.360
exist in this new world.

00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:32.110
Suddenly, they enter a stall and reach the
city of Venice.

00:01:32.110 --> 00:01:36.100
The monstrous creature almost gets them but
is shot by Phantom.

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:40.970
However, the attack only slows the creature
as its body reforms right after.

00:01:40.970 --> 00:01:44.760
The architect, who is confused out of his
mind, follows the others.

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:49.390
At last, one of them named Pilot jumps in
to stall the creature letting the other three

00:01:49.390 --> 00:01:54.810
get away at the expense of his own life.

00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:58.960
The architect asks them a lot of questions
about his whereabouts as they take him to

00:01:58.960 --> 00:01:59.990
a safe zone.

00:01:59.990 --> 00:02:04.730
A girl named Fly reveals that he is in a coma
and has entered a world where all the people

00:02:04.730 --> 00:02:06.940
who fall into a coma go.

00:02:06.940 --> 00:02:11.170
Since the human brain stores memories like
an electromagnetic field, when one goes into

00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:13.890
a coma, the memories become your reality.

00:02:13.890 --> 00:02:18.590
Hence the place is a collaborative memory
of everyone in the world in a coma.

00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:23.100
This explains the flying buildings and stalls
that lead to different parts of the world.

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:27.250
Still not able to comprehend what is going
on, the architect asks about the creature

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:28.820
that attacked them earlier.

00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:31.650
Fly explains that the creature was a braindead
person.

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:36.340
When a person dies in coma they turn into
such creatures called Reapers who have the

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:39.150
ability to turn others into creatures like
them.

00:02:39.150 --> 00:02:43.390
Fly, then stops the architect and slowly heals
the wounds in his head.

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:46.350
Finally, the three reach an abandoned old
bus.

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:51.130
They walk in through a door and walk out into
a completely different place through another.

00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:54.990
Fly explains that the memories of people are
all jumbled to form this world.

00:02:54.990 --> 00:02:59.590
So when a person remembers the bus to be on
a field and another remembers it near a building,

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:03.040
it creates a wormhole-like system that they
just experienced.

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:08.060
Phantom, Fly, and the architect meet a group
of people who are mad because they let Pilot

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:09.060
die.

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:13.220
The leader of the group named Yan tells everyone
it was worth it because now they have the

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:15.150
architect.

00:03:15.150 --> 00:03:20.360
He asks Fly to show the guest around and explain
everything to him.

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:24.459
The girl takes him to his room while explaining
why he was brought to the base.

00:03:24.459 --> 00:03:28.990
It turns out that their leader Yan got out
of coma once and figured out how the world

00:03:28.990 --> 00:03:30.040
of coma works.

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:35.430
None of the people remember who they were
in real life so they use made-up names like

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:41.310
the astronomer, the spirit, and so on.

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:45.700
They live a happy life in the new world except
when they are attacked by the reapers.

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:49.480
Yan believes that there is an island that
doesn’t have any reapers on it so their

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:53.349
group is always looking out for people who
can help them reach the island.

00:03:53.349 --> 00:03:56.560
The architect has been brought to the base
for the same reason.

00:03:56.560 --> 00:04:01.160
According to Yan, the architect could be of
great importance to them to help build a colony

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:02.599
on the said island.

00:04:02.599 --> 00:04:04.480
Fly leaves him alone to get some rest.

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:08.570
At night, the architect dreams of him driving
to a religious place.

00:04:08.570 --> 00:04:12.790
He vaguely remembers running out of the place
with a girl and getting into an accident.

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:16.949
When the man wakes up, his room has turned
into the site the accident took place in.

00:04:16.949 --> 00:04:21.560
The architect looks at the car and himself
inside it in fascination while the place he

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:25.569
visited before the accident has also materialized
from his dreams.

00:04:25.569 --> 00:04:29.439
Just then, Phantom enters the room watching
his dreams come to life.

00:04:29.439 --> 00:04:33.159
He sits down and warns the architect to stay
away from Fly.

00:04:33.159 --> 00:04:37.520
He also implies that he is the real leader
and Yan is just the brain of the group.

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:42.039
Then, the architect is taken outside for a
test to reveal his power.

00:04:42.039 --> 00:04:46.189
Phantom explains that everyone in the group
has one power or the other that derives from

00:04:46.189 --> 00:04:48.569
what they were good at in their real life.

00:04:48.569 --> 00:04:53.379
For example, a girl named Spirit can tell
when danger is approaching them, Fly can heal

00:04:53.379 --> 00:04:58.539
people, Phantom has insane strength, and so
on.

00:04:58.539 --> 00:05:02.729
To surface the architect’s strength, he
should be brought face to face with danger

00:05:02.729 --> 00:05:04.979
so his flight or fight can activate.

00:05:04.979 --> 00:05:08.110
For this purpose, Phantom orders a man to
shoot the architect.

00:05:08.110 --> 00:05:11.490
The test begins and the architect is shot
to the ground.

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:16.240
He is also attacked by a robot and is beaten
badly but his powers do not activate.

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:22.389
Seeing that he has failed the test, Yan appoints
him as a manual worker.

00:05:22.389 --> 00:05:27.050
A while later, Yan is told that they are running
low on the explosive they use to fight the

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:28.050
reapers.

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:32.099
So, Phantom and the people with special powers
make their way to an explosive factory.

00:05:32.099 --> 00:05:35.069
The architect asks to join them on their mission.

00:05:35.069 --> 00:05:38.530
Phantom doesn’t want to take him but agrees
when Yan orders him to.

00:05:38.530 --> 00:05:41.190
They finally reach the factory and see some
guards.

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:45.620
A confused architect is told that since the
person who dreamt of the factory also imagined

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:48.860
the guards, they will protect the factory
with their life.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:52.949
The group then attacks the guards and finally
reaches the place where the weapon is hidden.

00:05:52.949 --> 00:05:57.240
Two of them climb up the weapon to get it
out but right then, they notice three reapers

00:05:57.240 --> 00:05:58.710
coming their way.

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:02.830
Phantom orders the people getting the weapon
to continue while the rest of them run away.

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:06.639
In a time of crisis, the architect’s powers
manifest to life.

00:06:06.639 --> 00:06:09.669
He easily creates a bridge using his imagination.

00:06:09.669 --> 00:06:14.599
The person on the top of the weapon uses it
to come down below and they run away safely.

00:06:14.599 --> 00:06:17.830
Back at the base, everyone praises the architect
for his bravery.

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:21.860
Yan wants to set off to build an island with
the architect as soon as possible.

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:26.600
A surprised Phantom says he wants to discuss
it with Yan first but Yan dismisses him and

00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:28.860
makes the astronomer the team leader.

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:33.050
The astronomer has the ability to navigate
through the coma world using maps.

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:38.330
Phantom sarcastically asks Yan to tell the
others the whole truth only to be dismissed.

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:41.400
They plan to start their journey to the safe
place the following day.

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:46.879
At night, the architect tries to build something
like he did in the mission but fails to concentrate.

00:06:46.879 --> 00:06:51.869
Fly approaches him and suggests he imagine
the blueprint of the things he wants to build.

00:06:51.869 --> 00:06:56.610
As the architect does that, he is able to
create a structure in seconds.

00:06:56.610 --> 00:07:00.360
Later, they are in the astronomer’s room
looking at the crashed car.

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:04.819
Fly asks him if the girl in the car is someone
he loves and the astronomer replies that he

00:07:04.819 --> 00:07:05.900
doesn’t care.

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:10.379
He has started to like his new life in this
world where he can build wherever he likes.

00:07:10.379 --> 00:07:15.619
As they talk, the two end up kissing, unknown
that Phantom has been listening to their conversation

00:07:15.619 --> 00:07:18.949
all this time.

00:07:18.949 --> 00:07:22.580
The following morning, the group prepares
for the journey.

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:25.889
The astronomer makes a map of the route that
is safe from the reapers.

00:07:25.889 --> 00:07:29.449
But before they set off, Phantom brings a
reaper calling whistle with him.

00:07:29.449 --> 00:07:30.449
He plans to plant it on the architect so that
he would attract a reaper to himself.

00:07:30.449 --> 00:07:34.460
They finally start the journey but have to
stop midway when Spirit senses reapers coming

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:35.580
their way.

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:39.300
Phantom suggests they separate into different
directions to see where they're coming from

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:40.530
and report back.

00:07:40.530 --> 00:07:45.069
The architect goes in a direction along with
the whistle that was planted on him by Phantom.

00:07:45.069 --> 00:07:50.569
He is soon attacked by a reaper but is saved
by a man named Tank who Yan sent for his help.

00:07:50.569 --> 00:07:54.839
They return back to the group when everyone
finds out that Phantom is behind the reapers

00:07:54.839 --> 00:07:56.039
following them.

00:07:56.039 --> 00:08:00.460
Seeing himself being exposed, Phantom says
something about Yan hiding the truth.

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:05.370
But before he can explain himself, Yan shoots
him, turning him into a reaper as well.

00:08:05.370 --> 00:08:09.509
Soon, they are surrounded by many reapers
who kill two of their teammates.

00:08:09.509 --> 00:08:12.789
The others manage to run away while still
being followed by them.

00:08:12.789 --> 00:08:16.969
They are about to reach the safe zone when
the world around the architect starts disappearing

00:08:16.969 --> 00:08:19.419
and he begins to come out of the coma.

00:08:19.419 --> 00:08:23.809
His eyes open in the real world and suddenly,
he remembers everything that happened before

00:08:23.809 --> 00:08:24.810
the accident.

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:28.960
To his surprise, the girl who got into an
accident with him was Fly.

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:33.069
Before the accident, she drove him to a client
who was a religious leader who had a lot of

00:08:33.069 --> 00:08:34.319
devotees.

00:08:34.319 --> 00:08:38.560
Fly was scared for the architect’s safety
because the man wasn’t any normal client.

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:42.539
Hence she handed him a taser and waited outside
as he went in for the meeting.

00:08:42.539 --> 00:08:46.959
Inside, a man took him to the religious leader
who turned out to be Yan.

00:08:46.959 --> 00:08:50.500
All of them then entered a room with several
people on ventilators.

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:55.130
The architect was attacked as the people tried
to sedate him but he managed to escape using

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:56.130
the taser.

00:08:56.130 --> 00:09:00.269
Outside, he got into the car with Fly but
they were soon met by an accident.

00:09:00.269 --> 00:09:04.060
Back in the present, the architect wakes up
in a hospital bed beside Yan.

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:08.000
He asks Yan who he actually is and finds out
he is a scientist.

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:13.050
Yan had found out about life in coma and wanted
to experiment to make it a liveable world.

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:16.829
Hence, he established himself as a religious
leader to fund his experiment.

00:09:16.829 --> 00:09:21.519
Yan saw the architect’s ideas and wanted
to incorporate them into the coma world.

00:09:21.519 --> 00:09:26.670
That is why he put both Fly and the architect
into a coma, along with phantom and the others.

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:30.500
The architect retaliates saying that even
if he creates a perfect world, he will be

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:32.600
forcefully making the people stay in it.

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:35.330
Yan retaliates by showing him Phantom’s
real body.

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:39.500
He turns out to be handicapped in real life,
so he enjoyed being in a coma.

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:43.690
Hence, even when Phantom regained all of his
memory in that world, he never revealed it

00:09:43.690 --> 00:09:44.690
to anyone.

00:09:44.690 --> 00:09:48.940
Yan then asks the architect to go back into
a coma and help him to build the city of his

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:49.940
dreams.

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:53.800
In exchange, he agrees to spare everyone's
lives, including Fly’s.

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:58.170
Knowing that this is the only way to save
everyone, the architect accepts the offer.

00:09:58.170 --> 00:10:02.180
Before falling back into a coma, Yan reveals
that there is a way to get out of the coma

00:10:02.180 --> 00:10:06.959
from inside the place, but he will only show
it to the architect when his job is done.

00:10:06.959 --> 00:10:10.399
In the following scene, the architect again
wakes up in his apartment.

00:10:10.399 --> 00:10:13.850
However, this time, he has the memory of how
he reached there.

00:10:13.850 --> 00:10:17.129
He creates a bridge and runs to where the
rest of the group is.

00:10:17.129 --> 00:10:20.850
But instead of doing what he was told, the
architect reveals that Yan has been lying

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:21.850
to them.

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:25.930
Just then, Yan arrives there and forces him
to create the island just how he wanted him

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:26.930
to.

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:30.389
The architect fulfills his wish and constructs
a magical utopia.

00:10:30.389 --> 00:10:33.470
He finally asks Yan to let them go to the
real world now.

00:10:33.470 --> 00:10:38.829
However, first, Yan decides to tell them how
miserable their life was outside of the coma.

00:10:38.829 --> 00:10:43.490
Spirit was in a mental asylum, Tank was in
jail for killing his neighbors, while astronomer

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:50.020
was an autistic man with poor parents.

00:10:50.020 --> 00:10:55.220
He also declares the architect as the worst
of them all as his career was a massive failure.

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:58.430
Hearing this, Fly begins to get her memory
back as well.

00:10:58.430 --> 00:11:03.730
Spirit, Tank, and astronomer decide they want
to stay in the utopia but Yan reveals he cannot

00:11:03.730 --> 00:11:06.529
let them stay because they know the truth.

00:11:06.529 --> 00:11:10.930
Before the group can do anything, the people
from the real world induce cerebral hypoxy

00:11:10.930 --> 00:11:12.940
on them, making them brain dead.

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:18.621
Tank dies instantly while the others look
for a way to wake themselves up in the real

00:11:18.621 --> 00:11:19.621
world.

00:11:19.621 --> 00:11:23.690
They remember that Yan had always warned them
to not look into their materialized dreams,

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:26.920
hence, a way of getting out could be in one
of those dreams.

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:30.850
The group runs back to the base but Spirit
fades away before she can make it.

00:11:30.850 --> 00:11:34.770
The others enter the architect’s room and
walk into the building that he was kidnapped

00:11:34.770 --> 00:11:35.770
from.

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:39.569
They look for a way to go back into the room
only to see that the place has changed completely

00:11:39.569 --> 00:11:41.760
by people’s dreams merging with it.

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:46.410
The astronomer fades away on the way, leaving
the architect and Fly alone.

00:11:46.410 --> 00:11:50.440
Right then, the architect notices they are
in a painting that he saw in the room he was

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:51.440
abducted in.

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:57.120
However, Yan appears in front of them before
they can enter the painting.

00:11:57.120 --> 00:12:01.189
He is about to kill the two but they are saved
by a reaper at the last second.

00:12:01.189 --> 00:12:06.149
The reaper turns out to be Phantom who kills
Yan and lets the two go into the real world

00:12:06.149 --> 00:12:07.639
through the painting.

00:12:07.639 --> 00:12:11.439
After that, both Fly and the architect wake
up in real life.

00:12:11.439 --> 00:12:14.600
They walk out of the place without Yan’s
assistant stopping them.

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:17.089
The scene then changes to some weeks later.

00:12:17.089 --> 00:12:21.410
The architect has started working according
to his client’s ideas and has stopped innovating

00:12:21.410 --> 00:12:22.410
his own.

00:12:22.410 --> 00:12:24.199
He and Fly are a happy couple.

00:12:24.199 --> 00:12:28.620
Yan’s religious cult, however, is doing
as good as ever even after his death.

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:33.220
One day, the architect receives a letter from
the group again and keeps it safe with him,

00:12:33.220 --> 00:12:38.000
indicating that he might be on his way to
a second trip to the coma world.

